# R10 follow-up (2026-11-10): the 411MB of the 460MB build context copied into
# the image via `COPY . .` is this dev venv — the runtime stage installs its
# own site-packages into /usr/local from the builder stage, so the venv in the
# image is pure dead weight (~doubling image size).
